1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,200
Morning's here
美…好…的…

2
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,770
The morning's here
早晨又來到

3
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,040
Sunshine is here
陽光露臉

4
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,080
The sky is clear
晴空萬里

5
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,580
The morning's here

6
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:22,540
The morning's here
美好的早晨又來到

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,120
Hey!

8
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:28,380
Do you have to do that? It's Saturday!
你一定要唱嗎？今天是星期六

9
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,260
Oh,come on!
別這樣嘛

10
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,190
Morning's here!
早晨來到了

13
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:46,200
I hate this apartment!
我恨這層公寓

14
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:51,870
I hate this wall color! I hate that it still smells like bird!
我恨牆壁的顏色 我恨這裡還是有雞鴨的味道

15
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,780
I hate that singing guy!
我恨那個唱歌的人

16
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:58,650
Are you kidding? I love that guy!
不會吧，我好喜歡他

17
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,960
Morning's here
美好的早晨又來到…

18
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:04,390
Stop it!
閉嘴

19
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,290
I will kill you.
小心我宰了你

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,460
I hate that my room is so small.
我恨我的房間那麼小

21
00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:15,360
I have all the space I need. Do what I did.
我就覺得空間夠用，學學我吧

22
00:01:15,570 --> 00:01:19,470
You don't even have a bed. You sleep in a ball on the floor!
你連床都沒有 睡在地上的懶骨頭

23
00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:23,670
I am tired of your bellyaching.
你別再碎碎念了 

24
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:27,010
I've worked hard to make this a nice place for us.
我很努力的把這裡佈置舒適

25
00:01:27,650 --> 00:01:29,480
I know. I'm so sorry.
我知道，對不起 

26
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,310
I'm sorry,okay?
沒關係

27
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:33,020
It's a great apartment!
看吧，這裡很好

28
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:35,050
Shut up! This place is a hole!
閉嘴，這裡爛死了

29
00:01:37,690 --> 00:01:39,820
The One with All the Haste
本集播出：「閃電決定」

00:01:40,690 --> 00:01:41,820
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

30
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:31,440
I still can't believe you've got an earring!
我還是不敢相信你穿了耳洞

31
00:02:31,650 --> 00:02:34,620
I know,I know. Who am l? David Bowie?
我知道 我是誰？大衛鮑伊？

32
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,110
He does that?
他會那樣嗎？

33
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,950
I don't know. Whatever.
不曉得，隨便

34
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:43,590
I think it makes you look really dangerous.
你這樣看起來好危險

35
00:02:43,790 --> 00:02:45,280
Oh,I know.
我知道

36
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:47,820
You know what?
你知道嗎？

37
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:51,860
I never would've gotten this if it weren't for you.
要不是你，我永遠不會穿耳洞

38
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:54,500
When I'm with you,I'm like...
真的，跟你在一起時

40
00:02:54,700 --> 00:02:57,500
...this whole other guy. I love that guy!
我就變了一個人 我愛那個人

41
00:02:57,770 --> 00:02:59,830
I mean,I love you too. A lot.
我也很愛你

43
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:02,240
But that guy!
不過那個人…

44
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,710
I love that guy!
我愛那個人

45
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:05,780
I love both of you.
我愛你們兩個

46
00:03:08,950 --> 00:03:11,010
I wish I didn't have to go.
我好不想走

47
00:03:11,850 --> 00:03:13,120
Then don't.
那就別走

48
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,980
Stay here. Don't go so soon to London.
留下來 別急著回倫敦

49
00:03:16,190 --> 00:03:17,750
Just one more day.
再留1天就好

50
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,950
Please don't do this to me again.
羅斯，別再引誘我了

51
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:24,790
I'd stay,but I've already missed so much work. They'll fire me.
我也想 但我請了那麼多假，會被開除

52
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:28,060
So? Then you could stay as long as you want.
那你就可以盡情留下來了

53
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,630
I wish I could.
我也很想

54
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:34,800
Oh,no. Don't start packing.
不要，不要打包

55
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,070
Come on!
拜託啦

56
00:03:39,410 --> 00:03:42,320
I don't think you understand packing.
那不叫打包

57
00:03:43,050 --> 00:03:48,150
I don't want to leave it till last. Last time,I left my knickers here.
我不想拖到最後一刻 上次我把球鞋忘在這裡

58
00:03:48,390 --> 00:03:51,320
Yeah,I know. I tried them on.
我知道，我有偷穿

59
00:03:51,930 --> 00:03:53,330
You didn't!
不會吧

60
00:03:53,530 --> 00:03:56,000
No,I didn't. I didn't want to be "that guy."
騙你的，我不想學另一個我

61
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,870
Excuse me?
什麼？ 

62
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,670
Your pants.
你的褲子

63
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,850
Oh yeah! You like them?
喔對，你喜歡嗎？

64
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:19,680
I went to a used-clothes store and got maternity stuff.
我去二手衣店買孕婦裝

65
00:04:19,890 --> 00:04:22,360
These are so comfortable.
這條褲子好舒服

66
00:04:25,590 --> 00:04:28,760
Pheebs,those are Santa pants.
菲比，那是聖誕褲

67
00:04:30,670 --> 00:04:32,190
Santa pants.
什麼？ 聖誕褲

68
00:04:33,030 --> 00:04:34,900
Santa Claus' pants.
聖誕老人的褲子

69
00:04:36,340 --> 00:04:38,670
No. They're maternity pants.
才不是，這是孕婦褲

70
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:42,270
They even came with a list of baby names. See?
你看，還附贈寶寶姓名表

71
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:45,240
These names are good, and these are bad.
這些名字好，這些名字不好

72
00:04:51,790 --> 00:04:53,450
Hey,Phoebes.
菲比

73
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:55,790
So,how are the elves?
馴鹿都好嗎？

74
00:04:57,390 --> 00:05:00,760
I don't know. How are the...you know?
我不知道，那你…那個…

75
00:05:03,130 --> 00:05:05,100
Your clothes aren't funny.
你的衣服不好玩

76
00:05:06,730 --> 00:05:09,430
What should I wear to a Knicks game?
我該穿什麼去看尼克隊比賽？

77
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:12,460
A T-shirt that says, "l Don't Belong Here"?
上面印有 「我不看籃球」的衣服？

78
00:05:14,710 --> 00:05:15,770
You have tickets?
你們有票？

79
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:20,210
Mom got Dad's season tickets in the divorce,so she gave them to me.
媽離婚時分到爸的季票 就送給我了

80
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:22,580
Apparently,they're good seats.
位子顯然很好

81
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:25,220
Oh,my God! Those are almost on the floor!
天哪，幾乎就在場邊 

82
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:28,450
I could slip Woody Allen my resume.
我可以把履歷表塞給伍迪艾倫

83
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:30,280
Do you guys want these?
你們想要嗎？

84
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,860
Yeah,we do!
廢話

85
00:05:33,530 --> 00:05:34,690
Well,you got them!
那就給你們 謝謝

86
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:38,100
Just give us our apartment back.
只要把這裡還給我們

87
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:43,170
Oh,I didn't see that coming.
想不到有這一招

88
00:05:45,110 --> 00:05:46,100
Are you serious?
你是說真的？

89
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:50,000
Come on. We know what these are worth.
我們知道你們哈死這些票了

90
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,300
Do you think we're stupid?
你們以為我們是白癡嗎？

91
00:05:52,650 --> 00:05:55,840
Not stupid. You're meaner than I thought.
不是白癡，是很惡劣

92
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,670
What do you say?
如何？

93
00:05:57,850 --> 00:06:02,450
Forget it. I'm not giving up my bachelor pad for basketball seats.
想都別想，我才不會為了球票 放棄我的單身公寓

94
00:06:02,690 --> 00:06:04,780
Your "bachelor pad"?
你的單身公寓？ 

95
00:06:05,230 --> 00:06:07,220
Have you even had a girl here?
你帶女生回來過嗎？

96
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,590
No.
沒有

97
00:06:12,130 --> 00:06:15,660
But Joey has,and I usually talk to them in the morning.
但是喬伊有 我早上都會跟她們聊天

98
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,640
Yeah,you do!
沒錯

99
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,150
Come on!
拜託啦

100
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:30,680
Gunther,can I get two cups of chino,please?
阿甘，請給我兩杯奇諾

101
00:06:31,050 --> 00:06:32,310
Good one.
很有趣

102
00:06:33,590 --> 00:06:35,150
Come on. Season tickets!
季票耶！

103
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,520
Season tickets! You know what that means?
季票耶！你知道那代表什麼？

104
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,720
I'm not giving up the apartment.
別想了，我絕不讓出那層公寓

105
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:44,660
When I was a kid,my dad's company gave season tickets...
小時候我爸的公司都會送季票 

106
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:48,600
...to the No. 1 salesman every year. My dad never won.
給業績第一的業務員 我爸從來沒拿到過

107
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:53,070
Of course,he wasn't in sales. But still,I never forgot that!
不過他也不在業務部 但我還是一直耿耿於懷

108
00:06:54,410 --> 00:06:55,740
Hey guys!
你們在啊

109
00:06:57,850 --> 00:06:58,940
Oh,my God!
天哪

110
00:07:00,380 --> 00:07:02,680
We don't make enough fun of you already?
我們笑你笑得還不夠嗎？

111
00:07:03,790 --> 00:07:06,250
Oh,yeah. Emily convinced me to do it.
艾蜜莉說服我去穿的

112
00:07:06,850 --> 00:07:09,690
You do know that Wham broke up?
你知道「轟」解散了吧？ （喬治麥可出身之二人團體）

113
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:15,960
I like it. Emily likes it. That's what counts.
我喜歡，艾蜜莉喜歡 這樣最重要

114
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:20,190
So,how are you guys doing?
你們好嗎？

115
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:23,860
Don't try and talk all normal with that thing in your ear.
別戴了耳環還裝正常

116
00:07:24,940 --> 00:07:26,300
Where's Emily?
艾蜜莉呢？ 

117
00:07:26,810 --> 00:07:28,640
She's saying goodbye to her uncle.
去跟她舅舅道別

118
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,370
Didn't she,like,just get here?
她不是才剛來？ 就是嘛

119
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:33,870
Easy,tiger.
別激動，大哥

120
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:36,380
I just hate this so much.
我好討厭這樣

121
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:40,540
Every time I go pick her up at the airport,it's so great.
每次去機場接她，我都好開心

122
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:45,660
But I'm thinking,"I'll be right back in a couple of days,dropping her off."
但是我又會想 「過兩天又要送她來機場了」

123
00:07:45,930 --> 00:07:48,330
-So what'll you do? -There's nothing to do.
那你要怎麼辦？ 不怎麼辦

124
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,390
She lives there. I live here.
她住在那裡，我住在這裡 

125
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,830
She'd have to move here.
她得搬來這裡

126
00:07:53,270 --> 00:07:54,960
She should move here.
她應該搬來這裡

127
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,790
What?
什麼？ 

128
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:59,570
-I can ask her to live with me. -Are you serious?
我可以叫她跟我住 你說真的嗎？ 

129
00:07:59,810 --> 00:08:03,070
-I mean,why not? -You've only known her six weeks!
為什麼不行？ 你才認識她6星期

131
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:07,240
I've got a carton of milk in my fridge I've had a longer relationship with.
我冰箱裡有盒牛奶放得還更久

132
00:08:08,450 --> 00:08:11,480
Look,guys,when I'm with her, it's like....
我跟她在一起時 

133
00:08:11,990 --> 00:08:15,150
She brings out this great side of me.
她會激發出我好的一面

134
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:18,060
I mean,I love her,you know?
我愛她

135
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:20,250
And I love the milk!
我也愛那盒牛奶

136
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:24,430
But I won't ask some British girl to move in with me.
但我不會要一個英國女生 跟我同居

137
00:08:28,970 --> 00:08:30,960
Joey,you say things now.
喬伊，該你說了

138
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:35,270
Look,Ross. He's right. Emily's great.
羅斯，他說得對，艾蜜莉很棒 

139
00:08:35,710 --> 00:08:36,700
She's great!
她很棒

140
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:39,670
But this is too soon. You'll only scare her.
但這樣太快了，你只會嚇到她

141
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:41,980
I don't want to do that.
我不想嚇到她 

142
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:45,350
You don't want to wreck it. Don't go too fast.
沒錯，別壞了好事，別太心急

143
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:48,050
No. You're right. I know,you're right.
你們說得對

144
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:50,150
I'm not going to do it.
我不會這樣

145
00:08:51,290 --> 00:08:53,820
-Thanks guys. -No problem.
謝了，兩位

146
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:56,860
Just remember to wake us up before you go-go.
記得要走時搖它兩下 （「轟」所唱的歌詞）

147
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:10,010
It's too hard. Too hard!
太難了，太難了

148
00:09:11,650 --> 00:09:14,140
All right. Last chance for the tickets.
兩位，最後的機會

149
00:09:14,380 --> 00:09:17,910
Otherwise,I give them to my new boyfriend,Joshua.
否則我就送給我的新男友 約書亞

150
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:21,150
No,thank you.
不用了

151
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:24,690
Wait,wait. Come on,come on! Let's trade.
等一下…拜託，跟她們換啦

152
00:09:24,930 --> 00:09:27,990
The timing's perfect! I just clogged the toilet!
時機正好，我剛把馬桶堵住

153
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:34,390
I want those seats. But we can't live in the small apartment...
我跟你一樣想要球票 但住過這裡就覺得...

154
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:37,570
...after living here! Ever read Flowers for Algernon?
...對面太小了 你看過 「獻給阿爾吉濃的花束」嗎？

157
00:09:39,770 --> 00:09:41,570
Ever read Sports Illustrated?
有 你看過「運動畫報」嗎？

158
00:09:43,610 --> 00:09:45,440
No,I didn't read yours!
我沒偷看你的

159
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:47,410
We can go to the game tonight!
我們晚上就可以去看球

160
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:49,880
The only way I'll consider this is...
她們提出比季票更好的東西 

161
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,580
...if they offer more than just season seats.
我才要考慮

162
00:09:52,890 --> 00:09:55,250
-It's the Knicks! -Screw the Knicks!
是尼克隊耶 去他的尼克隊

163
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:03,090
I didn't mean that. I just meant that...
我不是那個意思 我是說...

164
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:06,270
...the apartment is worth so much more.
...這層公寓的價值要更大

165
00:10:10,270 --> 00:10:11,430
And the Knicks rule.
尼克隊萬歲 

166
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,970
Yeah,the Knicks rule!
對，尼克隊萬歲

167
00:10:14,610 --> 00:10:16,370
So? Are you going to do it?
怎樣？要不要？

168
00:10:17,710 --> 00:10:20,880
No,we're not going to because it's not an even trade.
不要，因為這個交易不公平

169
00:10:21,150 --> 00:10:22,140
All right,look.
好，聽著

170
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:25,380
What if you could keep the apartment and the tickets?
要是你們能保住公寓 又拿到球票呢？

171
00:10:25,590 --> 00:10:26,610
Done!
成交

172
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:30,720
Let me finish. I'm talking about a bet. Winner takes all.
讓我說完，我是說我們來賭 贏的人通殺

173
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,150
We could get nothing.
我們可能輸光光 

174
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:33,660
Or everything.
或是通殺

175
00:10:33,890 --> 00:10:35,290
I like that.
我喜歡

176
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,990
What do you say?
怎麼樣？ 不要

177
00:10:38,970 --> 00:10:39,960
Just do it!
賭了啦

178
00:10:40,170 --> 00:10:41,730
Oh! I'm convinced!
真有說服力啊

179
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:46,970
Come on,man! You know I'd do it for you.
拜託啦，我也會為你這麼做

180
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:49,640
Because you're my best friend.
因為你是我最好的朋友

181
00:10:50,510 --> 00:10:54,410
All right. But you can't use that again for a whole year.
好吧 但你1整年不准再用這招

182
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:55,940
I'm in.
我賭了

183
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:59,950
This is so exciting! What are you going to bet?
好興奮喔，你們要賭什麼？

184
00:11:00,150 --> 00:11:02,280
We should let Phoebe decide...
就讓菲比決定

185
00:11:02,490 --> 00:11:06,520
...because she's the only one who's impartial,and she's so pretty.
因為只有她沒有利害關係 而且她好美

186
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:11,820
I have a game!
我知道了

187
00:11:12,370 --> 00:11:14,930
-This is great! -What's the game?
很棒喔 比什麼？

188
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:18,190
It doesn't have a name. No,okay. Phoebe Ball!
沒有名字 不，叫菲比球

189
00:11:20,110 --> 00:11:22,170
No,it doesn't have a name.
不，沒有名字

191
00:11:25,150 --> 00:11:28,840
What is your favorite thing about trees?
摩妮卡 你最喜歡樹的哪一點？

192
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,320
-They're green? -Good! Five points!
樹是綠色的 很好，5分

194
00:11:39,990 --> 00:11:41,790
Same question.
喬伊，同樣的問題

195
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,330
-They're tall. -Three points!
樹很高 3分

196
00:11:49,970 --> 00:11:54,460
Both fine answers,but we were looking for leafy. Leafy.
都答得很好 但我們說的是闊葉植物

197
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,140
That's not even a game.
這根本不是比賽

198
00:11:58,350 --> 00:12:00,400
Shut up. We're winning!
閉嘴，我們領先

199
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:04,740
You want to finish this? We get a deck of cards.
你們想速戰速決？我們抽牌 

200
00:12:04,990 --> 00:12:06,680
High card wins. What do you say?
點數大的贏，如何？

201
00:12:06,890 --> 00:12:09,150
-Let's do it! -Oh,I have cards!
好，就這麼辦 我剛好有牌

202
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,820
Yeah. Here.
在這裡

203
00:12:11,060 --> 00:12:12,890
No,these are the trick deck.
這是魔術牌

204
00:12:14,100 --> 00:12:15,590
Here,yes.
這一副

205
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,500
Okay,you guys pick first.
好，你們先抽

206
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:25,740
-Four. -That's a low one!
4點 夠少了

207
00:12:29,110 --> 00:12:30,600
You look. I can't do it.
菲比，你看，我不敢看

208
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:32,850
What makes you think I can?
為什麼我就敢看？

209
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:35,570
Ace!
1點

210
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:41,450
Why are you hugging?
你們在爽什麼？ 

211
00:12:41,690 --> 00:12:43,180
We won our apartment back!
我們把這裡搶回來了

212
00:12:43,460 --> 00:12:46,720
What? Ace is high! Jack,queen,king,ace!
什麼？王牌最大 傑克皮蛋老K A

213
00:12:46,930 --> 00:12:49,620
No! Ace is low! Ace,two,three,four!
不對，1點最小，1234

214
00:12:57,470 --> 00:12:58,770
I don't know.
我不知道

215
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,540
Look it!
你們看

216
00:13:07,110 --> 00:13:08,310
Come on,pick again!
再抽一次

217
00:13:11,820 --> 00:13:14,450
Come on,apartment! Come on,apartment!
我要公寓，我要公寓

218
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:19,820
I know queen is high!
皮蛋點數很大

219
00:13:20,260 --> 00:13:21,730
Not as high as....
但是大不過…

220
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,730
It worked! King!
成功了！老K

221
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:29,330
We pick again! We pick again!
再抽一次

222
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,090
-Why? -I don't know.
為什麼？ 我不知道

223
00:13:32,970 --> 00:13:34,440
Tickets,please.
球票請拿來

224
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,800
Courtside,baby!
場邊區喔

225
00:13:40,010 --> 00:13:42,740
Seriously,good game,though. Good game.
很精彩的比賽

226
00:13:44,290 --> 00:13:47,950
What are they so mad about? They got the apartment back.
她們氣什麼氣？ 公寓都還給她們了

227
00:13:48,820 --> 00:13:50,090
No,they didn't.
沒有啦

228
00:14:00,700 --> 00:14:02,500
Packed while you were gone.
趁你不在打包好了

229
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:05,100
I left knickers under your pillow.
我留了雙球鞋在枕頭底下

230
00:14:07,010 --> 00:14:08,600
Move in with me?
搬來跟我住

231
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,330
What?
什麼？

232
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:15,280
Don't be scared. It sounds crazy, and people will say it's too soon...
別怕，我知道聽起來很瘋狂 別人會說太快了

233
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:20,280
...but just think. Think how great it would be.
但是你想想，那樣多棒啊

234
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:24,480
I don't know.
我不知道

235
00:14:26,330 --> 00:14:28,060
Leaving London....
要我離開倫敦…

236
00:14:28,330 --> 00:14:30,300
My whole family lives there....
我的家人都在那裡 我知道

237
00:14:30,530 --> 00:14:33,300
-My job. -You'll get a job here.
我的工作 你可以在這裡找工作

238
00:14:33,530 --> 00:14:37,560
I always hear about them foreigners stealing American jobs.
我常聽說美國人的工作 都被外國人搶走了

239
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:39,670
That could be you.
你也可以

240
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:42,200
Yeah,but it's my whole life.
但事關我的人生

241
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,340
You come to England.
你來英國

242
00:14:44,550 --> 00:14:47,540
I would. I really would. But my son is here.
我不行，我很願意 但我兒子在這裡

243
00:14:47,750 --> 00:14:51,710
I can't leave him. You don't think there's any way?
我離不開他 沒別的辦法了嗎？

244
00:14:53,590 --> 00:14:54,710
I don't think so.
我看是沒有了

245
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:59,750
It would be different if it was way into the future...
如果是長久的打算就不同了

246
00:14:59,990 --> 00:15:02,390
...and we were getting married.
例如結婚什麼的 

247
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,590
What?
什麼？

248
00:15:04,730 --> 00:15:09,500
Right. I shouldn't have said "married." Please don't go freaky on me.
好，我不該提結婚的 別被我嚇到

249
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:13,030
I didn't mean it. I take it back.
我不是認真的 我沒說，我收回

250
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,570
No. Don't.
不，不要收回

251
00:15:17,010 --> 00:15:18,000
Why don't we?
何不就這麼做？

252
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:20,440
Why don't we what?
做什麼？

253
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,510
Get married.
結婚啊

254
00:15:26,020 --> 00:15:27,010
You are mad!
你瘋了

255
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:32,020
No,I'm not! It's perfect. It's better than you moving here.
我沒有，這樣很完美 比你搬來住更棒

256
00:15:32,290 --> 00:15:35,390
It's us together forever, and that's what I want.
我們可以永遠在一起 我就是要這樣

257
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:38,150
-We've known each other six weeks! -I know.
我們才認識6星期 我知道，那又怎樣？

258
00:15:38,370 --> 00:15:42,030
So what? Who's to say? Does that mean we can't do it?
誰說不行？這樣就不行嗎？

259
00:15:42,270 --> 00:15:46,400
Look. I was with Carol for four years before we got married...
聽著，我跟卡蘿結婚前 在一起4年

260
00:15:46,610 --> 00:15:49,910
...and I wound up divorced from a pregnant lesbian.
最後跟一個懷孕的女同志離婚

261
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:53,940
I mean,this....
這麼做…

262
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:56,980
This makes sense for us.
對我們是順理成章

263
00:15:58,250 --> 00:16:02,920
Our first date,we ended up spending the whole weekend in Vermont.
我們第一次約會 就跑去佛蒙特度週末

264
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:06,180
I mean,last night I got my ear pierced. Me!
昨晚我還去穿耳洞，我耶

265
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,490
This feels right.
這個感覺很對

266
00:16:10,330 --> 00:16:11,320
Doesn't it?
不是嗎？

267
00:16:13,170 --> 00:16:15,500
My parents will be really mad.
我爸媽會氣死

268
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:18,400
Are you saying,"Yes"? Is that "Yes"?
你答應了嗎？那是好嗎？

269
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:20,160
Yes.
對

270
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:27,910
-We're getting married! -Oh,my God!
我們要結婚了 天哪

271
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,970
We're getting married!
我們要結婚了，天哪

272
00:16:31,290 --> 00:16:32,680
Come here,come here.
過來

273
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,600
Emily,will you marry me?
艾蜜莉，你願意嫁給我嗎？

274
00:16:46,872 --> 00:16:48,396
願意

275
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,170
It's a bit small.
有一點小

276
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:57,380
Damn! I thought that'd be romantic as hell.
真是的，我還以為會很浪漫

277
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:01,940
It was.
是很浪漫

278
00:17:13,390 --> 00:17:16,300
Those were,like, the best seats ever!
真是史上最棒的位子

279
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:20,060
Should we give these to the girls? Like a peace offering?
要不要把衣服送給女生 表示和解？

280
00:17:20,330 --> 00:17:23,530
That's very nice. Plus,they were free and too small.
好主意，反正不用錢又太小

281
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,570
Oh,God!
天哪

282
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:38,620
Hey,you want a beer?
你要喝酒嗎？

283
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:43,650
I know!
我知道

284
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:49,160
Open up! Open up! Open up!
開門！開門

285
00:17:50,530 --> 00:17:52,660
We'll discuss it in the morning.
明天早上再說

286
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:02,330
What the hell is going on?
這是怎麼回事？

287
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:06,010
We took our apartment back!
我們把我們家搶回來了

288
00:18:09,620 --> 00:18:11,310
I had nothing to do with it.
跟我無關

289
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:18,250
Okay,it was my idea. But I don't feel good about it.
好吧，是我的主意 但我並不好過

290
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:25,020
We are switching back right now.
我們現在就換回來

291
00:18:25,470 --> 00:18:27,260
No,we're not. We're not leaving!
不要，我們不走

292
00:18:27,470 --> 00:18:29,530
You'll have to. You both have jobs.
你們非走不可，你們都有工作

293
00:18:29,770 --> 00:18:33,230
As soon as you do,we'll switch back! You can't stop us.
等你們去上班，我們就換回來 你們阻止不了的

294
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:36,030
-Right,Joe? -I don't know.
對吧，喬伊？ 我不曉得

296
00:18:40,050 --> 00:18:41,140
What?
什麼？

297
00:18:41,650 --> 00:18:44,050
I don't want to move again,with....
我不想再搬了

298
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:48,950
This is our apartment and they stole
我不管，這是我們的公寓 她們偷了…

299
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,990
You stole!
你們偷了！

300
00:18:51,530 --> 00:18:54,550
Our apartment! We won it fair and square. Twice!
我們的公寓 我們光明正大的贏了兩次

301
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:58,660
And I am getting it back right now! I'm getting it back right now! 
我現在就要要回來 我現在就要要回來

302
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:01,060
All right.
好

303
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:06,960
We figured you might respond this way,so we have a backup offer.
我們早料到會有這種反應

304
00:19:07,210 --> 00:19:10,180
No more offers. You can't offer anything to us!
所以我們準備了備案 不要，你們搞不定我們的

306
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:14,710
-Let us keep the apartment and -As a thank you...
讓我們留在這裡 為了表示感謝

307
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:20,990
...Rachel and I will kiss for one minute.
瑞秋和我會接吻1分鐘

308
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:27,730
-Totally worth it! -That was one good minute!
完全值得 好爽的1分鐘

309
00:19:27,930 --> 00:19:28,990
Good night.
晚安 晚安

310
00:19:34,770 --> 00:19:37,500
-Men are such idiots. -I know.
男人真是白癡 就是啊

311
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:42,330
Can you believe something that stupid actually got us our apartment back?
那麼白癡的事 居然讓我們得逞了

312
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:45,770
If you had just done that after the last contest...
要是你們上次比完就這麼做 

313
00:19:46,010 --> 00:19:48,210
...no one would have had to move at all.
誰都不必搬家

314
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:53,750
Let's pretend that's not true.
就裝做沒這回事

315
00:19:57,060 --> 00:19:58,550
Scarf's done.
圍巾織好了

316
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:03,790
Come on,come on!
快點 好

317
00:20:07,130 --> 00:20:08,120
What's going on?
怎麼了？ 

318
00:20:08,370 --> 00:20:11,030
Ross has some big thing to tell everyone.
羅斯有大事要宣佈

319
00:20:15,140 --> 00:20:17,630
Emily and l,we decided...
艾蜜莉和我決定…

320
00:20:17,910 --> 00:20:19,140
...to get married.
...要結婚

321
00:20:22,580 --> 00:20:23,640
What?
什麼？

322
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,450
Oh,are you pregnant too?
你也懷孕了？

323
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:29,550
No.
沒有

324
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:32,960
When did How did you
什麼… 怎麼…

325
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:36,290
We just decided to go for it.
我們就是決定要結婚

326
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,830
We know it's a bit hasty...
這個決定是倉卒了些

327
00:20:39,770 --> 00:20:41,930
...but it just feels so right.
但是… 感覺真的很對

328
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:48,830
I was just telling the guys
我正在告訴他們… 

329
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:51,100
Yeah,I heard.
我聽到了

330
00:20:57,180 --> 00:20:59,020
I think it's great!
太好了

331
00:20:59,950 --> 00:21:01,320
I'm so happy for you!
我真替你高興

332
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:03,460
Well,yeah! Congratulations!
是啊，恭喜

333
00:21:12,270 --> 00:21:14,630
I can't believe you're getting married!
你居然要結婚了 

334
00:21:18,670 --> 00:21:20,700
Monica and Rachel made out.
摩妮卡和瑞秋親熱

335
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:34,680
Morning's here
美…好…的…

336
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:37,410
The morning's here
早晨又來到

337
00:21:37,690 --> 00:21:40,490
Sunshine is here
陽光露臉

338
00:21:40,690 --> 00:21:41,920
The sky is clear
晴空萬里

339
00:21:42,460 --> 00:21:44,900
The morning's here
美好的早晨

340
00:21:45,100 --> 00:21:48,070
-Hey,you're back! -Hey,get into gear
你回來了 準備就緒

341
00:21:48,670 --> 00:21:50,430
Breakfast is near
早餐就快上桌 

342
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:55,730
The dark of night has disappeared
夜晚的黑暗一掃而空

343
00:21:55,980 --> 00:21:57,810
I'll see you tomorrow morning!
我們明天見 好

344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


345
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

